        <div class="about-text reveal">
          <p>Software Security Engineer with a solid technical background in <span class="highlight">Systems and Computer Engineering</span>. Experienced in low-level systems analysis, secure software architecture, and technical vulnerability assessment.</p>
          <p>Skilled in researching complex domains from kernel drivers to mobile applications and applying engineering principles to build and secure diverse technical environments.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-stats reveal">
          <div class="stat-card">
            <span class="stat-num">KMDF</span>
