        <div class="timeline-item reveal">
          <div class="tl-marker">
            <div class="tl-dot"></div>
            <div class="tl-line"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-card">
            <div class="tl-meta">
              <span class="tl-date">2025 — Current</span>
              <span class="tl-badge">Remote</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Security Researcher — Remote Application Penetration Tester</h3>
            <p class="tl-company">Independent Research</p>
            <ul class="tl-list">
              <li>Conducted a black-box security assessment of a production Android application.</li>
              <li>Exploited Client-Side Data Integrity Failure (CWE-359) on unencrypted local SQLite databases.</li>
              <li>Identified high-severity Information Disclosure (CWE-200) via leaked storage endpoints.</li>
              <li>Demonstrated Synchronization Bypass attack (CWE-284) against unvalidated backend inputs.</li>
              <li>Authored a formal remediation report mapping findings to OWASP Mobile Top 10 risks.</li>
