          <p class="project-desc">Kernel-level monitoring system with vulnerability classification, custom Wazuh SIEM integration, and WatchZork Terminator module for threat quarantine.</p>
          <div class="project-tech">
            <span>C</span><span>KMDF</span><span>Python</span><span>Wazuh</span>
